  (text "MCU notes:\n- Native USB on IO19/IO20 (USB_D-/D+) programs the board; no USB-UART bridge.\n- Recovery: hold BOOT (IO0) and press/release RESET, or replug.\n- Current sense on ADC1 only (IO8/9/10), VM sense on IO7; ADC2 is unusable while Wi-Fi is on.\n- R22-24 / C43-45: 330R + 22pF per TI 9.2.1.1.6, place near the ESP32.\n- Strapping pins IO3, IO45, IO46 left unconnected. IO26 is reserved for in-package PSRAM.\n- MCPWM: INHA IO33, INLA IO47, INHB IO21, INLB IO18, INHC IO17, INLC IO16.\n- SPI to DRV8316: CS IO12, SCLK IO13, MOSI IO14, MISO IO15. nSLEEP IO34, nFAULT IO48, DRVOFF IO35.\n- Encoder I2C: SCL IO1, SDA IO2. GPIO order follows the PCB layout."
    (at 228.6 121.92 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "3e397029-a7dc-411f-93f7-e9627bec1a80")
  )
